transformation = "Preserve all 387 historical path/owner entries, add the real control_plane.py as exactly one root-exclusive ownership entry, and explicitly bind the split runner control paths. The artifact still requires exactly 388 entries; the 387 patchable paths remain byte-for-byte allocations, with the approved prelude still forbidden from changing twice."
outputs = "tests/fixtures/repair_22_33_973/approved-prelude-ownership.json, the generated PRELUDED_SERIAL_OWNERSHIP_SHA256, matching canonical registry source-policy/policy digests and bootstrap/prelude-review-22.33.973.json carrying source and output identities."
refusals = "A missing approved prelude is refused before reading ownership or manifest artifacts. With a valid prelude, altered ownership bytes retain the distinct artifact differs from reviewed hash refusal."

